  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "歡迎逐家來三峽tshit-thô！ "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳可宸（Tân Khó-sîn）</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家好，我是陳可宸，我蹛tī三峽，若是有朋友beh來三峽tshit-thô，我ē tshuā in來拜訪阮tsia上出名ê清水祖師廟，沓沓仔行、慢慢仔se̍h，tuè李梅樹先生ê藝術作品，體會廟宇ê suí。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一輾se̍h了，lán suà--落-來往舊街仔hit爿行行看看--leh。舊街仔內商品百貨五花十色，愛啥有啥，lán先來牽一支仔烏仁目鏡，koh來一領仔藍染ê手工衫，配一跤仔上流行、上時行ê「阿媽牌ka-tsì袋仔」，tse m̄-nā tshia-iānn koh好看頭，家己看了心情規个清爽--起-來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老街規tsuā是lò-lò長，lán若se̍h kah忝--ah，就來去揣一間茶館，lim一杯仔碧螺春，歇喘--一-下，kā心靜--落-來、欣賞店內ê輕音樂，恬恬仔看窗外來來去去ê旅客，心情放輕鬆，hōo時間慢慢仔經過。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh倚晝--ah，腹肚bē-sái囥hōo iau，lán來食好料--ê。若beh食飽，舊街仔內有賣三峽上出名ê排骨飯、古早味ê米篩目，啊若beh食巧，lán tsia mā有點心「山泉水豆花」tshuân leh等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">食飽活跳跳，lán就tshuā朋友去三峽大板根森林園區散步。Tsia m̄-nā thang認bat豐富koh多元ê樹林生態，koh ē-sái tī散步ê當中，ná行ná吸收大自然ê芬多精，hōo lán完全放輕鬆，bē記得煩惱kah鬱卒。Se̍h一輾了，流規身軀汗，koh來浸一下仔溫泉，實在是tsiok sù-sī--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán ê行程到tsia，算是到一段落。我相信我ê朋友一定ē感覺三峽是一个文化豐富koh tsiok好tshit-thô ê好所在。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">（作者是安溪國中八年仔ê學生）</div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh3HUwS9CLay9m2RLxSATscsVXMKLBvGAhtoXNBoyHGu6T9_EdMuTqjIvKtdFuN7QWkN_SEzcI2Vq5xzJ6BdNsb51QMg159gtXn4IIZ1WFdWRDe2Rq0JQLHD381XjhPkZbbM9IVob1fZEsYIbdBs9yRB2L2mmGDq1TlL37nLZnWJZnDP3XwygrC_VT-bm7A/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh3HUwS9CLay9m2RLxSATscsVXMKLBvGAhtoXNBoyHGu6T9_EdMuTqjIvKtdFuN7QWkN_SEzcI2Vq5xzJ6BdNsb51QMg159gtXn4IIZ1WFdWRDe2Rq0JQLHD381XjhPkZbbM9IVob1fZEsYIbdBs9yRB2L2mmGDq1TlL37nLZnWJZnDP3XwygrC_VT-bm7A/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/s1424/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/w450-h640/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"s